{
  "name": "AmneziaWG-ESP32",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "AmneziaWG (obfuscated WireGuard, protocol 3.x) VPN client for ESP32 on Arduino/PlatformIO. Junk packets, Sx-prefixes and ChaCha20 header protection on top of a WireGuard-lwIP core. Brings up a lwIP interface and routes all device traffic through the tunnel.",
